brary.','Internet','Block C','Library Building / Ground Floor','Reading Hall','High','Open',NULL,'Internet','High',2,'2026-09-18 02:14:59','2026-09-18 02:14:59',NULL),(6,5,'Spilled drinks and trash near Canteen exit','Large spill of sweet tea and overflowing trash bins attracting flies and creating a slippery hazard.','Trash overflow and drink spill creating slippery hazard near canteen.','Cleaning','Block D','Student Center','Canteen Exit Gate','Medium','Resolved',NULL,'Cleaning','Medium',1,'2026-09-11 21:14:59','2026-09-13 04:14:59','2026-09-13 04:14:59'),(7,6,'Broken wooden bench with sharp protruding nail','Bench in row 4 has a cracked backrest and a sharp nail protruding from the side. Potential injury risk.','Broken bench backrest with exposed sharp nail.','Furniture','Block B','Science Block / 3rd Floor','Room 310','High','Assigned',NULL,'Furniture','High',1,'2026-09-14 05:14:59','2026-09-14 05:14:59',NULL),(8,7,'Window latch broken in Seminar Hall 1','The large glass window cannot be securely latched and bangs violently when winds pick up.','Window latch broken in seminar hall causing rattling in wind.','Doors/Windows','Block C','Auditorium Complex','Seminar Hall 1','Low','Resolved',NULL,'Doors/Windows','Low',1,'2026-09-06 20:14:59','2026-09-09 00:14:59','2026-09-09 00:14:59'),(9,8,'Ceiling fan making loud screeching noise','Middle ceiling fan in Lecture Hall 101 vibrates violently and emits a loud metallic screeching noise.','Ceiling fan vibrating violently with loud metallic noise.','Electrical','Block A','Main Academic / 1st Floor','Room 101','Medium','Open',NULL,'Electrical','Medium',1,'2026-09-12 21:14:59','2026-09-12 21:14:59',NULL),(10,9,'Drinking water cooler tap leaking continuously','The push tap on the 3rd floor water cooler is stuck open and draining clean drinking water constantly.','Water cooler tap stuck open wasting drinking water.','Plumbing','Block B','CS Building / 3rd Floor','Corridor near 305','Medium','Resolved',NULL,'Plumbing','Medium'